calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows April to May came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. In 2025, September to October ran 37% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 176% of normal on that same middle. Grid 14575 had its driest year in 1954 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
